                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font
                                    face="仿宋">Xiaoli Wei, Ph.D. Young Research Fellow | Department of Pharmacology, Fudan University She teaches undergraduate courses such as Pharmacology for medical-related majors and Drug Metabolism and Pharmacokinetics, along with postgraduate courses like Advances in Advanced Pharmacology and Advanced Clinical Pharmacology. She has published one teaching reform paper in the journal Pharmaceutical Education. As the first or corresponding author, she has published 16 high-impact papers in prestigious journals, including Nano Today, Advanced Materials, Advanced Science, ACS Nano, and Journal of Controlled Release, achieving an h-index of 35. Dr. Wei has led two national-level research projects and received several accolades, including the Shanghai High-Level Overseas Talent Introduction Program, and the Second Prize of the Ministry of Education's Natural Science Award. She also serves as a Young Editorial Board Member for Nano Letters and the Asian Journal of Pharmaceutical Sciences. </font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
