                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font
                                    face="仿宋">cyzhan@fudan.edu.cn</font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
                </td>
                <td width=182 valign=top style="width:109.6500pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:none;
mso-border-left-alt:none;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font
                                    face="仿宋">He is a secondary professor and doctoral supervisor at Fudan University. He is a recipient of the National Outstanding Young Scientist Fund and the head of a key innovation team in Shanghai. He is the deputy director of the Ministry of Education Key Laboratory of Intelligent Drug Delivery. He leads his team in conducting basic and clinical translational research on lipid nanomedicines, with a particular focus on the study of the in vivo process and regulatory mechanisms of lipid nanomedicines in the body. The related research results provide references for the design, development and clinical application of lipid nanomedicines. He has published over 120 papers in authoritative journals in this field. After returning to China, he has applied and obtained more than 10 Chinese patents and PCT patents, and many of them have been transformed/assigned. He has been responsible for projects such as the National Natural Science Foundation of China Key, Young Investigator, Hong Kong Cooperation and Shanghai Major Projects. He has received awards such as the 2022 Ministry of Education Young Science Award, the 2019 China Pharmaceutical Association - Yiling Biomedical Young Award, the 2016 Ministry of Education Natural Science Award Second Prize and the 2016 Shanghai Natural Science Award Second Prize. He teaches undergraduate courses such as Drug Metabolism Kinetics, Pharmacology, and MBBS English Class Pharmacology; Advanced Pharmacology, Advanced Clinical Pharmacology, Advanced Neuropharmacology. He has been selected for the Medical Talent Cultivation Project of Fudan University Shanghai Medical College and has published two teaching reform papers.</font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
