mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font
                                    face="仿宋">Professor, doctoral supervisor, deputy director and secretary of the Party branch of the Department of Pharmacology at the School of Basic Medicine of Fudan University. Deputy chairperson of the Reproductive Pharmacology Committee of the Chinese Pharmacological Society, member of the Physiology and Pharmacology Committee of the Chinese Sleep Research Society，member of the Extreme Environment and Sleep Committee of the Chinese Sleep Research Society， member of the Teaching and Popularization Committee of the Chinese Pharmacological Society. Research directions： (1) The influence and mechanism of sleep on cognition and emotion； (2) Research on sleep-wake mechanisms. Has presided over 3 national natural science foundation projects of the National Natural Science Foundation of China and 2 Shanghai natural science foundation projects. Participated in the "Innovation Group" project of the National Natural Science Foundation of China and the "Brain Program" of the National Science and Technology Department. Published research papers as the first and corresponding author in international journals such as Nature Communications， PloS Biology， Translational Psychiatry， and Sleep. Undertaken teaching of undergraduate courses such as "Pharmacology" for clinical medicine eight-year program， five-year program， pediatrics， forensic medicine， and clinical medicine for international students； teaching of integrated courses for undergraduate students in basic medicine； responsible for the "Sleep and Health" course of Fudan University's general education courses. Guided 12 undergraduate students' innovation projects including Zhengyi and Wangdao. Compiled 1 national planning textbook "Pharmacology" and 2 supplementary textbooks， and participated in the compilation of more than 10 other textbooks.</font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
